I never seem to have a very high hp max when I win.  I am a little curious
as to how people get 20th+ level characters, since it seems that it would
take forever to kill enough monsters to get that high (even killing demons,
et.al.).  I think my highest winning character so far was level 18.  My
lowest was a level 14 priest, with 88 hp.

On the other hand, I usually have a really good weapon, so maybe that makes
up for it.  My winning priest had a +13 Excalibur, and AC -33.  My armor
class mostly ends up in the -20 to -30 range; I don't really know if that's
considered abnormally low.  The worst weapon I finished with was a +1 Mjollnir,
or maybe it was the +5 Excalibur, it depends on who you ask.

